From 18414b931d5825c2e6878bdfa3e504aaeaaa2ab0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Meng Li <Meng.Li@windriver.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Jun 2025 12:24:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] t23x: overlay: add dts to support Arducam 6 channels of
 camera imx477 on Orin AGX platform

In below link, select radio button of "Partner Camera Solution",
https://marketplace.nvidia.com/en-us/enterprise/robotics-edge/
it shows that the Arducam camera module B0473 is supported by
NVIDIA jetpack 6.2 SDK on Orin AGX board. There is imx477 driver
in NVIDIA kernel oot source code package, but there is no corresponding
dts for the  imx477 camera. So, refer to below 2 xisting camera dts
to create a dts file for Arducam 6 channels of camera imx477.
tegra234-p3767-camera-p3768-imx477-dual.dts
 tegra234-p3737-camera-imx390-overlay.dts

Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Meng Li <Meng.Li@windriver.com>
---
 overlay/Makefile                              |    1 +
 .../tegra234-p3737-camera-imx477-overlay.dts  | 1084 +++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 1085 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 overlay/tegra234-p3737-camera-imx477-overlay.dts

